{"4344790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Difficult Drivers", "steam_appid": 4344790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive with a friend in Difficult Drivers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share accelerating and steering controls with everything demanding teamwork. Time throttling, tapping brakes, calling turns, and threading narrow paths without getting knocked off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles, recover from mistakes, and keep pushing toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/370e737f8689a4e84a648257d799be4a.poster.avif?t=1770902908\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/370e737f8689a4e84a648257d799be4a.webm?t=1770902908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/370e737f8689a4e84a648257d799be4a.mp4?t=1770902908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Communication is key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed<strong>, </strong>you will have to work together... but that can be difficult when things get heated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your cool and try not to get too upset with your driving partner when they forget to brake — or turn left instead of right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Split Controls (and Role Swaps)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around <strong>coordination</strong>, whether you’re communicating constantly or swapping roles to handle different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade responsibility</strong> and <strong>adapt</strong> to a multitude of timings and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Car Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car isn't just a prop; It has its own physics simulations that can make for some dramatic (and wacky) fails and saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/408f1c7c9a7e815f7fda81c1de58fed9.poster.avif?t=1770902908\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/408f1c7c9a7e815f7fda81c1de58fed9.webm?t=1770902908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/408f1c7c9a7e815f7fda81c1de58fed9.mp4?t=1770902908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you work better alone, play <strong>solo,</strong> where you manage both inputs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive with a friend in Difficult Drivers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share accelerating and steering controls with everything demanding teamwork. Time throttling, tapping brakes, calling turns, and threading narrow paths without getting knocked off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles, recover from mistakes, and keep pushing toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/370e737f8689a4e84a648257d799be4a.poster.avif?t=1770902908\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344790/extras/370e737f8689a4e84a64